2025-09-03 22:26:17,626 - evaluation_logger_Attraction-28 - INFO - Final Response: The Tokyo Tower features a modern digital playground spread across three floors, offering a variety of high-tech attractions suitable for all ages. Visitors can enjoy nearly 20 attractions, including AR bouldering, AR dodgeball, VR rides, and a full-scale e-motor simulation area. Starting April 24, 2024, there's also a "robot fight" attraction that requires an additional fee. The facility provides a nostalgic experience with digital retro games and is accessible via public transportation. 

One popular option is the "Red Tokyo Tower Night Ticket," which costs approximately $25.29 USD. This ticket includes admission, WiFi, all fees and taxes, restroom access, and unlimited rides on all attractions. The attraction is wheelchair accessible, and infants and small children can ride in prams or strollers. Service animals are allowed, but there are some health and height restrictions, so please be mindful of those.

The attraction offers free cancellation and is operated by RED° Tokyo Tower. Be sure to bring your ticket with you, and note that operators may cancel for unforeseen reasons.

